\item[* task:] creating an NP out of {\em each other} and {\em one another}.
Note that the genitive forms {\em each other's\/} and {\em one another's} also 
are basic expressions (caused by Dutch: elkaars). These forms must be used in 
the genitive formation rule (RNPformation5) to replace the basic forms.
